              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Scutarii have hand weapon, throwing spear and shield, and may have javelins (+1). Feigned Flight. Stealth. May upgrade to heavy throwing spear (-2), but lose Feigned Flight if they do.</characteristic>
