              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Celtiberians have hand weapon, throwing spear and shield, and may have javelins (+1). Feigned Flight. Warband. Stealth. May upgrade to heavy throwing spear (-2), but lose Feigned Flight if they do. A Celtiberian army cannot contain Scutarii. In an Iberian army, there may be one Celtiberian unit for every three Scutarii units, and it cannot be larger than the smallest Scutarii unit.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="2f25-6951-affe-1cf8" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
